"√(1 − (f_c/f)²) = √(1 − (1.737/4)²) = 0.9008.",
"u_p = c/0.9008 = 3.33×10^8 m/s (greater than c, but information travels at u_g = c²/u_p = 2.702×10^8 m/s).",
